      "id": "I_kwDOMswq686fBcRE",
      "title": "TLS ALPN is \"coap\", not \"coaps\"",
      "url": "https://github.com/core-wg/coap-dtls-alpn/issues/1",
      "state": "CLOSED",
      "author": "cabo",
      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Section 2 claims:\r\n\r\n> For CoAP over TLS an ALPN ID was defined as \"coaps\" in [[RFC8323](https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ietf-core-coap-dtls-alpn-00.html#RFC8323)].\r\n\r\nThat is not true, please see \r\n\r\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8323.html#section-11.7\r\nand\r\nhttps://www.iana.org/assignments/tls-extensiontype-values/tls-extensiontype-values.xhtml#alpn-protocol-ids",
      "createdAt": "2024-11-18T10:07:51Z",
